  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P has $1.1B in contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P received 47 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $22.5M. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P obligations are down 51.1% year over year. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P obligations rose and fell across the last six fiscal years: $103M in FY21, $604M in FY22, $2.1B in FY23, $2.3B in FY24, $2.2B in FY25, and $1.1B in FY26. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P concentration is heavy in one market: Military Armored Vehicle, Tank, and Tank Component Manufacturing accounts for $996M of FY2026 to date obligations, followed by Engineering Services at $41.9M and Motor Vehicle Gasoline Engine and Engine Parts Manufacturing at $19.8M. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P also shows minimal or zero obligations in several listed NAICS lines, including Motor Vehicle Body Manufacturing at $102K and multiple categories at $0.",
    "sections": [
