        "heading": "How has Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P's federal business trended year over year?",
        "body": "Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P obligations are down 51.1% year over year. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P obligations by fiscal year were $103M in FY21, $604M in FY22, $2.1B in FY23, $2.3B in FY24, $2.2B in FY25, and $1.1B in FY26. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P FY2026 totals are partial (fiscal year to date)."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Where does Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P earn most of its federal revenue?",
        "body": "Military Armored Vehicle, Tank, and Tank Component Manufacturing is the largest market for Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P at $996M in FY2026 to date. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P also earned $41.9M in Engineering Services and $19.8M in Motor Vehicle Gasoline Engine and Engine Parts Manufacturing in FY2026 to date. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P shows minimal obligations in Motor Vehicle Body Manufacturing at $102K and zero obligations in several listed NAICS categories."
